Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `xs` cannot be changed by `.push()` while `window` is still looking into it
  --> tests/ui/ownership/named_range_view_blocks_owner_resize_and_replacement.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     xs.push(4)
    |     ^^
 Why: `window` is a live read view into `xs[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `window` before changing `xs`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
